/components-menu-figma-examples--navigation" target="_top">Menu — navigation and nested items</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-chips-figma-examples--information-chips" target="_top">Chips — information, removal and choices</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-tooltip-figma-variants--source-variants" target="_top">Tooltip — 52 source variants</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-accordion-figma-composition--closed" target="_top">Accordion — expand and collapse</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-search-bar-figma-composition--search-and-clear" target="_top">Search — type, clear and submit</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-sticky-footer-figma-composition--price-and-action" target="_top">Sticky Footer — price and Add to cart</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-chat-figma-conversation--conversation" target="_top">Chat — conversation and message composer</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-accordion-local-source-set--all-eight-tuples" target="_top">Local Accordion — eight source variants</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-cards-local-source-masters--both-themes" target="_top">Local Cards — light and dark masters</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-expanded-source-coverage--local-labels" target="_top">Local Labels — five variants</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/components-expanded-source-coverage--scrollable-tabs" target="_top">Scrollable Tabs</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/foundations-original-illustrations--all-original-artwork" target="_top">Original Illustrations — 72 artworks</a></li><li><a href="./?path=/story/actual-figma-ds-guidance-and-content-rules--content-guidelines" target="_top">Content guidelines and examples</a></li><li>For the working prototype, use the shared release preview or run <code>npm run figma:dev</code> from the downloaded source.</li></ul><p>Implementation is in progress. Switzer Variable is bundled from the supplied Croma font file.</p><details><summary>Source and review notes</summary><p><a href="https://www.figma.com/design/2WzKPv4y8rw4zJ94LmI3yS/Croma-DS">Croma’s actual Figma file</a> is the source. The local Button set and linked guide family remain distinct. Written values take priority; saved styles, component properties and original artwork fill unwritten gaps. Hidden written tables are included and hidden template rows are excluded.</p><p>Rendered stories do not by themselves establish full visual acceptance. Earlier written-only checks and extraction records are retained in the repository. The acceptance evidence story shows the historical checkpoint; current work prioritizes usable components and direct visual review.</p></details></main>};

